You are a senior full-stack web developer.

Build a complete responsive web application for a “Student Assignment Tracking and Grading System” with 2 user roles: Teacher and Student.

The web app must help students track pending assignments, view scores for each assignment, receive deadline reminders, and automatically see updated grades when teachers score their work.

Teachers must be able to create assignments, set due dates, view student submissions, grade them, leave comments, and have those updates automatically shown to students.

Use this tech stack:
- Frontend: Next.js 14 (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS
- Backend: Next.js API Routes / Server Actions
- Database: PostgreSQL
- ORM: Prisma
- Authentication: NextAuth
- Validation: Zod
- State/Data fetching: React Query
- Realtime updates: Pusher or Socket.io
- Notifications: in-app notifications
- Optional email simulation for reminder notifications

The generated code must be clean, modular, reusable, and ready to run locally.

