========================================

There are 2 roles:

1) Student
- Register and login
- View dashboard
- View all assignments
- See assignment statuses:
  - Pending
  - Upcoming
  - Submitted
  - Waiting for grade
  - Graded
  - Overdue
  - Missing
- Submit assignments
- View scores and teacher comments
- Receive notifications about:
  - deadlines coming soon
  - due today
