  - graded assignments
  - updated teacher comments

2) Teacher
- Register and login
- Create and manage classes
- Create subjects
- Create assignments
- Set title, description, due date, full score, and optional attachment
- View all student submissions
- Grade each submission
- Add comments/feedback
- Edit grades later
- When grading is saved, the student must automatically see the updated score

