========================================
6. BUSINESS LOGIC
========================================

Implement these rules:

- Teachers create assignments for a class/subject.
- Students can see only assignments for their enrolled classes.
- Students can submit work before or after due date.
- If due date is passed and no submission exists, assignment status becomes Overdue or Missing.
- If submission exists but not graded yet, status is Waiting for grade.
- If teacher enters a score, status becomes Graded.
- When a teacher grades a submission:
  - save grade
  - update submission status
  - create notification for the student
  - trigger real-time update so the student sees the new score immediately

- Create scheduled reminder logic for notifications:
  - 7 days before due date
  - 3 days before due date
  - 1 day before due date
  - on due date
  - after overdue

